{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17111310","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17111310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1711131001:1":{"text":"終わった……少なくとも今は、空を覆っていた影は晴れた。デューラ様、私たちは勝ったのですよね？","source_cn":"结束了……至少这一刻，天空不再被阴影遮蔽。女神，我们已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8651685EA71CE218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1711131002:0":{"text":"ご覧なさい、ローランド。決着はついても、エスペリアの奥底の震えはまだ止んでいません。私たちの光は、いまだそこまで届いていないのです。","source_cn":"看啊，罗兰。尘埃虽已落定，但伊索米亚深处的震颤从未停歇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F64E39A604D3DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1711131003:0":{"text":"万物を呑み込まんとする悪意は、今も深き深淵の底に巣食っています。","source_cn":"那意图吞噬万物的恶意，依然盘踞在不可触及的深渊之底。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B2A32404587B5B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1711131004:0":{"text":"それは闇の中で牙を研ぎ、エスペリアを滅ぼす次なる災厄を生み出そうとしているのです。","source_cn":"它在黑暗中磨砺爪牙，在静默中编织下一次足以毁灭伊索米亚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63F46F5DF43BDAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1711131005:1":{"text":"苦難に満ちた征途が幕を下ろす日は、まだまだ先のようですね。","source_cn":"看来这艰苦卓绝的抗争，还远远没有到谢幕的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE3574ED0FA307D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1711131006:0":{"text":"これはもとより、終わりなき征戦です。ですが、エスペリアは貴重な休息の時を手にしました。","source_cn":"这本就是一场永无止境的远征。但伊索米亚已经获得了最宝贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x744015DD1E698A90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1711131007:0":{"text":"気を緩めてはなりません。深淵が完全に目覚める前に、人の子らを守るに足る国を築き、光をもって彼らの恐れを払いなさい……","source_cn":"不要松懈，罗兰。在那深渊彻底苏醒前，去建立起足以守护凡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB55AA39D35589628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1711131008:1":{"text":"時は流れ、ブライト王国は次第に力を増していった。けれど、神々にとって人の一生は、ほんの一瞬にすぎない……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x988D111CEE4CA865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1711131009:1":{"text":"お久しぶりですね、ローランド。","source_cn":"罗兰……好久不见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C36DD221EA5109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1711131010:1":{"text":"デューラ様、あなたはかつて、人々を守る国を築けと私に命じました。その国は今、ようやく形を成しつつあります。ですが私の旅路も、ひとつの境に差しかかっているようです。","source_cn":"女神，您曾让我建立守护凡人的国度，如今它已初具轮廓。但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B708580A29D2BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1711131011:1":{"text":"あなたの意志を宿すこの剣は、あまりにも重い。人の身である私には、これ以上振るい続けられません。","source_cn":"这柄承载着您意志的剑太过沉重。以我这具凡人之躯，已经无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8098F49C1F921C04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1711131012:1":{"text":"あなたは人間でありながら、神々さえ目を見張る奇跡を成し遂げました。ですから――","source_cn":"你以凡人的血肉之躯，创造了连神明也为之侧目的奇迹。对此——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F35C574938B1CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1711131013:1":{"text":"生命の女神の名において、あなたを永遠の領域へ迎えましょう。人の身の枷を脱ぎ、セレスチアルとして、あなたが守り抜いた大地を共に見守るのです。","source_cn":"我以生命女神之名，邀你踏入永恒的领域——褪去凡人的桎梏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D21B5770585339D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1711131014:1":{"text":"使命を終えたのち、私は土へ還るつもりでした。ですが、ブライトはまだ生まれたばかりの赤子も同然です……","source_cn":"如果可以顺从私心，我本愿在使命终结后回归尘土。但耀光帝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7F3B1904996301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1711131015:1":{"text":"もし、なおもこの国と共に在ることを許されるのなら、私はその永遠の責務を引き受けましょう。","source_cn":"如果您愿意赋予我继续陪伴它的特权，我将接下这份永恒的责任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A86FF67AF4B8E38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1711131016:1":{"text":"セレスチアルとして表舞台を退くのなら、現世の王座を継ぐ者は、すでに定めてあるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"既然你将以半神的姿态隐于幕后，那么凡世的王座，你选好继...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D6DCD0C890BBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1711131017:1":{"text":"いえ、私は後継者を自ら選ぶつもりはありません。","source_cn":"我拒绝行使这项权利，女神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7150B8ECCA2484B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1711131018:1":{"text":"なぜです？","source_cn":"为何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC917B55BD15D3199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1711131019:1":{"text":"人間がどれほど貪欲で、短慮で、移ろいやすいものかは、私自身よく知っています。人の目は、神の視野には遠く及びません。私が選ぶ後継者も、常に正しい道を選べるとは限りません。","source_cn":"我终究是从凡人走来，我深知人类的贪婪、短视与多变。凡人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833345709DB7BCE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1711131020:1":{"text":"ですから、その選択は、不滅の神であるあなたに委ねたいのです。","source_cn":"所以，我将这个选择权交还给您，交还给不朽的神明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFEABC37AE9029CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1711131021:1":{"text":"相変わらず慎重で、どこまでも冷静な人ですね。未来を独りで定めることを望まないのなら、<style=\"highlight\">運命</style>に選ばせましょう。","source_cn":"你总是这么谨慎而清醒。既然你不愿独断未来，那就让<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C8E8602C400BEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1711131022:1":{"text":"ローランド、あなたの剣を、この岩に突き立てなさい。","source_cn":"罗兰，将你的剑，刺入这块磐石之中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD73AECF9D35802E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:23::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"picture_config_only","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1711131023:1":{"text":"これは……！","source_cn":"这是……！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9D63D099B18B14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1711131024:1":{"text":"エスペリアで、これほど奇妙な物質は見たことがありません。まるで何かの……息づかいが宿っているような……","source_cn":"我从未在伊索米亚见过如此奇特的物质，它仿佛蕴含着某种…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C6FA4E04438B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1711131025:1":{"text":"赤子は母体を離れる時、つながれた臍の緒を断たねばなりません。そうして初めて、独立した命を得るのです。","source_cn":"婴儿脱离母体之时，必须斩断相连的脐带，方能获得独立的生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B340D4E2711074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1711131026:1":{"text":"そして神々もまた、本来は、自らを創り出した存在と固く結ばれていました。","source_cn":"而神明，原本也与创造祂们的存在紧紧相连。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0F3D50D5A07E41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1711131027:1":{"text":"神を創り出した……存在……","source_cn":"创造神明的……存在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3419F5B134D4C5E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1711131028:1":{"text":"人は誰しも、父と母より生まれます。神にもまた、それを育む母胎があるのです。万物は、生命の木が司る大いなる循環から逃れることはできません。","source_cn":"凡人，皆有父母。神明，亦有孕育祂的温床。生灵万物，本就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD36F523796F06F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1711131029:1":{"text":"生命の木とは？","source_cn":"生命树是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1D49683935255F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1711131030:1":{"text":"いずれゆっくりお話しします。ともかく、この磐石こそが、かつて私とその存在をつないでいた臍の緒なのです。","source_cn":"之后我会慢慢告诉你。总而言之，这磐石，便是曾经连接着我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94841924922E698A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1711131031:1":{"text":"自ら選んだ道を歩むと決めた時、私はこの手でそれを断ち切りました。","source_cn":"当我决心走上自己选择的道路时，我不顾一切代价，亲手斩断了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58FCA39BEBEE48A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1711131032:1":{"text":"さあ、この剣を媒介に、永遠なる試練を設けましょう。あなたの血を継ぐ者、そして魂が私の意志と共鳴する者のみが、この剣を目覚めさせることができます。","source_cn":"以此剑为引，立下永恒的试炼吧。与你关联的血肉，且灵魂与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE9072822F26F4C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1711131033:1":{"text":"抜剣を成し遂げた者が、ブライト王国の継承者となるのです。","source_cn":"拔剑者，即拥有继承耀光帝国的资格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E45D4C23148B46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗兰":{"text":"ローランド","source":"罗兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:艾雅":{"text":"デューラ","source":"艾雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏文本":{"text":"黒画面テキスト","source":"黑屏文本","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":35,"localized_text_count":34,"speaker_count":3}}